# --- Institutional / copyrighted reference material (kept local only) ---
# NCH cardiac rotation documents, shared fellow articles, and the full NCH
# Sharepoint manual library — used as off-line reference for developing this
# app, never redistributed. Only anonymised, hand-curated structured data
# under src/data/specialty/ may be committed.
original_pictures/Cardiac Anesthesia Rotation guide*.docx
original_pictures/Anticoagulation Protocol*.docx
original_pictures/Transfusion Protocol*.pdf
original_pictures/articles/
original_pictures/Sharepoint/

